        "title": "Date DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 10/17 and Fast 10/17 display names",
        "summary": "The shared model catalog in `common` updates the display names for the DeepSeek V4.1 Flash and DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Fast rows to include the build date 10/17, reflecting an upstream build change on 2026-10-17 that did not bump the version number. This naming convention distinguishes the specific 1017 build for returning users, as the undated wire id auto-updates and would otherwise look unchanged. The updated labels are propagated to the English and Chinese root READMEs and the CLI release README, where they appear in the model picker tables and FAQ copy. The `compactChatModelName` and `shortModelName` utilities strip the trailing date for collapsed UI triggers, so the full date only appears in open menus.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
